operator measuring signed transverse position in a ribbon with two internal \
states per site. RibbonBulkBoundaryOperator[points, normalVector, \
internalDimension] uses internalDimension internal states per site. \
RibbonBulkBoundaryOperator[points, normalVector, internalDimension, \\ power] \
raises the magnitude of the rescaled transverse coordinate to power while \
